#REDIRECT [[wikipedia:Gumroad]][https://gumroad.com/ Gumroad] is a third party marketplace and distribution platform used by [https://creators.vrchat.com/ creators] to sell and distribute digital products.

These products vary widely, but commonly include 3D models, VRChat avatars, avatar clothing and accessories, textures and etc.

Within the '''VRChat community''', Gumroad has been used by many independent creators to distribute avatars, avatar assets, clothing, shaders, tools and other creations. Products are generally provided as downloads after purchase, with the exact contents and installation requirements depending on the creator.

VRChat related products sold through Gumroad may require the buyer to have a basic understanding of software such as [https://unity.com/ Unity] and the [https://creators.vrchat.com/sdk/ VRChat SDK]. Some products may also require additional packages or assets to function correctly.

For more in depth information vist the [[wikipedia:Gumroad|Gumroad Wiki page]]